# Phase gates

- Phases 0–3 are approved and frozen.
- Phase 4 is engineering standards and governance. It is not permission to build the app.
- Do not start Phase 5 (design system), implementation planning, or production code until the product owner authorizes that phase.
- Leave these open: client framework, Android Speak Time mechanism (H15), voice display names, long-term widget identity.
- Spike results become decisions only when `docs/architecture/Spikes.md` has Evidence and Decision filled and the decision log is updated. Opinion is not evidence.
- When architecture changes, update the architecture doc and add a Product Decision Log entry in the same change. Do not let code become the spec.
